```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Caller
    participant Contract as DoubleFinancingPreventer
    participant State as assets mapping

    Caller->>Contract: registerAsset(assetId)
    Contract->>Contract: require(assetId > 0)
    Contract->>Contract: require(assets[assetId].owner == address(0))
    Contract->>State: assets[assetId] = Asset({ owner: Caller, pledged: false, lender: 0, lienAmount: 0 })
    Contract->>State: assetsByOwner[Caller].push(assetId)
    Contract-->>Caller: AssetRegistered(assetId, Caller)
```
